  archetypes:
  - Archetype: 1
    Name: Pumper
    Line: Steadily create prisms at a higher rate than others.
  - Archetype: 2
    Name: Builder
    Line: Creates prisms that protect fauna and other stationary prisms.
  - Archetype: 3
    Name: Burster
    Line: Cause a large and quick increase in team volume to give your team an immediate boost to your score.
  - Archetype: 4
    Name: Sapper
    Line: Steadily reduce enemy prisms over time.
  - Archetype: 5
    Name: Specialist
    Line: Reliably get to primary targets, counter special prisms, and prevent burst cultivation.
  - Archetype: 6
    Name: Nuke
    Line: Destroy large numbers of enemy prisms all at once.
  - Archetype: 7
    Name: Harraser
    Line: Use silence abilites to counteract enemy Aggressors.
  - Archetype: 8
    Name: Zoner
    Line: Creates fields that prevent prism damage
  - Archetype: 9
    Name: Enhancer
    Line: Buff ally prisms to protect and heal them from enemy attacks.
